WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.288
Let’s walk through Green and Industry Proposals.

00:00:03.288 --> 00:00:06.662
Review each proposal as a recipient-specific workflow.

00:00:06.662 --> 00:00:09.675
Confirm the intended audience, terms, and White Cell

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:13.762
notes before forwarding, and preserve separate append-only threads so

00:00:13.762 --> 00:00:18.150
one recipient cannot see or alter another recipient’s negotiation

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:18.312
.

00:00:18.312 --> 00:00:21.337
On this slide, review proposals, forward them to

00:00:21.337 --> 00:00:24.863
named recipients, request changes, or reject them with

00:00:24.863 --> 00:00:26.212
White Cell notes.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:31.060
In practice, recipient threads remain isolated and append-only

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:33.760
so negotiation can be reconstructed.

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:36.785
When you are ready, use Open Green and Industry

00:00:36.785 --> 00:00:39.498
Proposals to move to the live surface.

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:42.310
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:42.460
.
